/image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fDsnCKdy82Yw6OzJ2zzxwrh2iRP.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Princess Hop / Benny & the Troll\",\"overview\":\"Hoot gets bossy when it’s her turn to choose what to play. Benny's favorite doll, Sir Ben, is taken by a friendly troll.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q6jqs4kORDvaz6HJF73hcdXnSZC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-04-04\",\"runtime\":22},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Benny's Birthday Book / Dessert Disaster\",\"overview\":\"Filipa gifts Benny a handmade book for his birthday, and it becomes his favorite. Hop, Penny, and Hoot make the Best Cake Ever for Lonny's Birthday.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zKGJ6r09RLwFNwwrsosKmgbX8ti.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Hop's Rainy Day / Jinxed!\",\"overview\":\"Hop is sad that is hasn't rained in Fair Village in a while. Hoot goes away for the day, and she leaves Jinx in the care of Hop and Penny.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7fpX3RXEb1K2mu0Bk8swO2vtJbk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"A Muddy Mess / Dress Mess\",\"overview\":\"Hop challenges Ronny to a mud-boarding competition to win back Lake Lucky. Filipa designs a fashion show outfit, but she doesn't like loud events.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1ZdgjtEWnQnWxxQqFa3FUhow6t4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Broadway Benny / Benny to the Moon\",\"overview\":\"Benny tells a really exciting story, which the Hoppers think should be made into a play! Benny wonders what it would be like to go to the moon.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jBqDPErO0Ypgl1SkT2IQ7olobYs.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Nosey Friends / The Big Bounce\",\"overview\":\"2Much and Delisha jump to conclusions about a mysterious package. Hoot enlists the help of Detective Penny Pecksniff to get a lost toy back.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yrSynBZuKf9owWlhAZ9roIrkXMG.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Chicken Dance / Hop to the Rescue\",\"overview\":\"Hop tidies up Hoot's barn and throws out something to help calm her chickens. Hop helps Frida rescue a rare violet but almost ruins it with his truck.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9Xk2YERUi3113duQO0pGyMQSmVq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Training Terry / Stickyberry Jam\",\"overview\":\"The Hoppers decide it's time to start training Baby Terry and will need help. Benny and Penny get stuck together just before Penny's dance-off.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z2UVE8cgwMfL9bpf3uV1KXD8PqI.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2024-08-15\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"The Big Fight / Honest Penny\",\"overview\":\"Benny and Hoot turn a simple argument into an epic trial. After accidentally taking home Jerome's stuffy, Penny tries to discreetly put it back.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/4978/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Super Hop / Brand New Ho\",\"overview\":\"Hop believes he has superpowers until they fail him during a rescue. Hop is overwhelmed running the diner solo, so Filipa makes him a robot.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/4979/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"Grape Lightning Gone / Hop's New Shoes\",\"overview\":\"Filipa loans Grape Lightning to Ronny but quickly misses her favorite tool. Hop fears he'll have to drop out of a race after his shoe-lift breaks.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/4980/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"Act Your Age / Lonny Leaves\",\"overview\":\"Penny risks losing her friendship with Earl when Lonny calls her immature. After a fight with her siblings, Lonny moves in with Hop and Penny.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/4981/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":18,\"name\":\"Dragon Terry / Penny's Big Break\",\"overview\":\"Baby Terry attempts to become a dragon. Penny helps Filipa to build a huge statue -- but Hop worries it will turn into a disaster.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/4982/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":19,\"name\":\"Sister Brother Day / Who's the Best\",\"overview\":\"Lonny learns that \\\"Sister Brother Day\\\" isn't just about doing what she wants. Hop and Penny become obsessed with winning Benny's new game.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/4983/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-04-03\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":20,\"name\":\"The Sticker Uppers / Can Do Clean Up Crew\",\"overview\":\"The Hoppers stick up for Benny when he is bullied during a contest. Hop cleans up Fair Village in his rescue truck after a storm.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/4984/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-14\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Unhappy Camper / Take a Deep Breath\",\"overview\":\"Hoot and the Hoppers' camping trip doesn't go as planned. After Filipa's meltdown, Benny worries he'll upset her again.\",\"still\":\"https://media.kitsu.app/episodes/thumbnails/4985/original.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2025-08-14\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":22,\"na